WEBVTT

00:00:00.440 --> 00:00:03.440
(Episode 71)

00:00:02.120 --> 00:00:02.920
Sudah dingin

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:04.880
Belah dadanya

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:05.640
Ah?

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.320
Cepat lakukan

00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:09.080
Baik, baik

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:19.800
Dia suruh 
orang lain lakukan

00:00:20.080 --> 00:00:20.880
Sudah dibelah

00:00:21.160 --> 00:00:22.120
Lalu apa?

00:00:22.120 --> 00:00:23.120
Kemari

00:00:25.720 --> 00:00:26.520
Tuan Linken 

00:00:27.760 --> 00:00:29.320
Orang ini 
sudah mati total 

00:00:29.320 --> 00:00:30.600
mana mungkin selamat

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.560
Posisi luka 
di jantungnya

00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.960
menembus atrium kiri

00:00:35.320 --> 00:00:38.000
panjang lukanya 
sekitar 3cm 

00:00:42.400 --> 00:00:43.520
Bagaimana kamu tahu?

00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:45.920
Diagnosis benang sutra

00:00:47.080 --> 00:00:49.160
Gak mungkin, Linken

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.920
kamu bisa diagnosis benang sutra?

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:53.560
Lalu gimana kamu bisa melakukannya?

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:54.720
Benar juga

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:56.000
Dia gak melihatnya

00:00:56.240 --> 00:00:58.720
tapi tahu di mana letak luka di jantungnya

00:00:59.080 --> 00:00:59.920
Aku periksa dulu

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:03.680
Astaga, benaran! 
Itu benaran! 

